sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Operator
  participant C as Control Plane
  participant M as Model Gateway
  participant P as Policy Engine
  participant A as Approval Service
  participant T as Tool Gateway
  participant R as Runner
  participant X as Range Target
  participant O as Observability
  U->>C: Submit signed engagement/ROE
  C->>M: Request analysis
  M-->>C: Structured tool intent
  C->>P: Authorize intent
  alt approval required
    P-->>C: approval_required
    C->>A: request approval
    A-->>C: signed approval
    C->>P: re-evaluate
  end
  P-->>C: allow + obligations
  C->>T: one-time execution grant
  T->>R: start approved adapter
  R->>X: bounded test
  R->>O: evidence
  T->>O: decision and result metadata
  C->>R: destroy
